4. use the Model to provide paid model inference, fine-tuning, distillation, or model-hosting services to third parties.

A Qualified Small Entity may use the Model internally for free, but may not provide a Commercial API Service without a commercial license. A commercial license may be requested from the repository owner through GitHub.

